    "created_at": "2024-08-13T16:10:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-13T16:10:23Z",
    "body": "I always assumed that the user agent holds shared/service worker agent clusters and BCGs. And BCGs hold window agent clusters alive. I don't think that the user agent has a need to separately hold window agent clusters. (As you wrote in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6127#issuecomment-722638881 as well.)",
